# A Claude chat handed to OpenCode mid-way: the "Context handoff" line where the new session took over.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
project storefront shop
chat Ada claude:builtin-claude
say "Sketch the orders table"
settle 10
core handOff {"agentId":"$chat","provider":"opencode","model":"opencode/big-pickle"}
settle 4
say "Carry on from there"
settle 16
snap context-handoff
